 "_s9d_palettes_basis": "s9d palettes: 1.21.8 palettes kept their registry and resize handler (javap -c: set by the constructors) and used them in idFor/read/write/getSerializedSize; 1.21.9's take both per call. The layer gives the two fields back under 1.21.8's names (CbPalette*FieldsMixin), fills them where a palette is made with them known (PalettedContainer: its strategy's registry and itself, CbPalettedContainerTagMixin; 1.21.8 constructors, static creates, Palette.Factory.create and copy(resize), redirected to rt/CbPalettes), and 1.21.8's calls hand 1.21.9's methods the palette's own pair. Strategy: 1.21.8's registry-free PalettedContainer.Strategy is a facade (bodies 1.21.8's) giving the 1.21.9 strategy of its kind per registry; Configuration moved to Configuration.Simple (same constructor and components); the container constructors, codecs, pack and Unpacker.read hand 1.21.9 that strategy (rt/CbPaletteContainers). Open: super(...) of a mod's palette or container subclass, implementations of the old Palette.Factory.create / Unpacker.read, and 1.21.8 Configuration.createData",
